{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/Title-3.png?t=1709273709\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/SoMuchSnow.png?t=1709273709\" /><br>A mysterious cold spell traps you in your cozy home. Your old dog Jedediah is sick and to top it all off, the heating suddenly breaks! Will you dare to enter a cursed world to fix it?<br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/JedWagMirrored.gif?t=1709273709\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/Features.png?t=1709273709\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short and sweet <strong>Liminal Adventure Game</strong>, with dashes of CRPG.<br></li><li>Talk to the people of Snow Cone, unravel a <strong>mind-bending mystery</strong>.<br></li><li>Succeed or fail in spicy situations with a <strong>roll of the dice</strong>. Failing is half the fun!<br></li><li>Choose your Mood to get a bonus on some rolls:<br></li><li>Be <i>Empathic</i> - Sense your way around a conversation with compassion &amp; charisma!<br></li><li>Be <i>Logical</i> - Use reason and deduction to your advantage!<br></li><li>Be <i>Ruthless</i> - Confront things with some good ol' brute force!<br></li><li>An experimental, synth-heavy soundtrack with bleeps and bloops.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lucky Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/7b0b48df76ba8e44e3d2df27b0c322c5f52ddcca.jpg"},{"name":"A new friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/ce6703ac06b357b38c1ae1f62b9fa4dcd8f77b6c.jpg"},{"name":"Punch A Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/c6bc48c33ccc5bf18b920f5e71711e91e372e545.jpg"},{"name":"Insult Majel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/1d13fc268882f0be09143dd4d2fc052c06ef1e5f.jpg"},{"name":"Eat The Icebowl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/d95e2ac6c63899db3a659f3ccb207188a4b46ac3.jpg"},{"name":"Mr. Vacuum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/a618d3703f364ec239aab7fa25db0a50d1f5c243.jpg"},{"name":"Music Freak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/da28bcdfcf16f452b63941dcaef742170d3fa666.jpg"},{"name":"Liquid Synth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/f28c15a42d7eec49fd8a79d6b3e95ca01acdef9d.jpg"},{"name":"Punch Jacob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/a4af063b35af8584b75fadc205302cdc701ccfc1.jpg"},{"name":"Be A Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784660/054aa98d0c610fe5324d5c2c42e7587c556902f8.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2784660?t=1709273709","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1709273709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1709273709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1709273709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/Title-3.png?t=1709273709\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/SoMuchSnow.png?t=1709273709\" /><br>A mysterious cold spell traps you in your cozy home. Your old dog Jedediah is sick and to top it all off, the heating suddenly breaks! Will you dare to enter a cursed world to fix it?<br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/JedWagMirrored.gif?t=1709273709\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/Features.png?t=1709273709\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short and sweet <strong>Liminal Adventure Game</strong>, with dashes of CRPG.<br></li><li>Talk to the people of Snow Cone, unravel a <strong>mind-bending mystery</strong>.<br></li><li>Succeed or fail in spicy situations with a <strong>roll of the dice</strong>. Failing is half the fun!<br></li><li>Choose your Mood to get a bonus on some rolls:<br></li><li>Be <i>Empathic</i> - Sense your way around a conversation with compassion &amp; charisma!<br></li><li>Be <i>Logical</i> - Use reason and deduction to your advantage!<br></li><li>Be <i>Ruthless</i> - Confront things with some good ol' brute force!<br></li><li>An experimental, synth-heavy soundtrack with bleeps and bloops.</li></ul>","developers":["Potion Of Midi"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/header.jpg?t=1709273709","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256993824,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993824/movie480.mp4?t=170862